  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVAX Advance Market Commitment Core Contributions for Financial Years 2021-22 to 2029-30</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provides core contributions to the COVAX Advance Market Commitment, which is the centrepiece of global efforts to ensure equitable distribution of safe and effective COVID-19 vaccines when available. Eligible countries include developing countries in South East Asia and the Pacific. Funding is provided through a combination of direct grants and contributions through GAVI, the Vaccine Alliance&apos;s International Finance Facility for Immunisation (IFFIm).</narrative>
  </description>
